ag}\")\nEOF","workdir":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-bgij0ztn/retort-d0fbbb4f4ea5"},"output":"Serie A 2021 BRF pairs>2: 72\n  ['internacional-rs', 'red bull bragantino']\n     2021-01-31 Internacional 2 - 1 Bragantino\n     2021-10-22 Internacional 1 - 1 Bragantino\n     2021-12-10 Bragantino 1 - 0 Internacional\n  ['bahia', 'fortaleza']\n     2021-02-21 Fortaleza FC 0 - 4 EC Bahia\n     2021-09-05 EC Bahia 4 - 2 Fortaleza FC\n     2021-12-10 Fortaleza FC 2 - 1 EC Bahia\n  ['atletico-mg', 'gremio']\n     2021-01-20 Gremio 1 - 1 Atletico Mineiro\n     2021-11-04 Atletico Mineiro 2 - 1 Gremio\n     2021-12-10 Gremio 4 - 3 Atletico Mineiro\n  ['ceara', 'palmeiras']\n     2021-01-24 Ceara 2 - 1 Palmeiras\n     2021-10-20 Ceara 1 - 2 Palmeiras\n     2021-12-10 Palmeiras 1 - 0 Ceara\n  ['atletico-pr', 'sport']\n     2021-02-26 Athletico Paranaense 2 - 0 Sport Recife\n     2021-09-05 Athletico Paranaense 0 - 0 Sport Recife\n     2021-12-10 Sport Recife 1 - 1 Athletico Paranaense\n  ['atletico-mg', 'red bull bragantino']\n     2021-01-11 Bragantino 2 - 2 Atletico Mineiro\n     2021-08-30 Bragantino 1 - 1 Atletico Mineiro\n     2021-12-05 Atletico Mineiro 4 - 3 Bragantino\n\nfixtures with multiple competition labels in BRF 2021: 0\nBrasileirão Série B 2014: 275 played, 20 teams, expected 380\nBrasileirão Série B 2015: 378 played, 21 teams, expected 420\nBrasileirão Série B 2016: 380 played, 20 teams, expected 380\nBrasileirão Série B 2017: 381 played, 23 teams, expected 506\nBrasileirão Série B 2018: 377 played, 20 teams, expected 380\nBrasileirão Série B 2019: 378 played, 22 teams, expected 462\nBrasileirão Série B 2020: 302 played, 20 teams, expected 380\nBrasileirão Série B 2021: 446 played, 28 teams, expected 756\nBrasileirão Série B 2022: 380 played, 22 teams, expected 462\nBrasileirão Série B 2023: 380 played, 20 teams, expected 380\nBrasileirão Série C 2014: 81 played, 20 teams, expected 380\nBrasileirão Série C 2015: 157 played, 23 teams, expected 506\nBrasi